Package: firemath
Type: Package
Title: Withdrawal-Rate and Savings-Rate Arithmetic for Early Retirement
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("James", "Verlander", email = "scrapertweeter3@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: James Verlander <scrapertweeter3@gmail.com>
Description: Two small calculators for financial-independence planning:
    fire_math() stress-tests a fixed real withdrawal against a
    constant-real-return portfolio and reports the first failed year, the
    check the 4% rule skips at long horizons; fire_savings_rate() converts
    a savings rate into years to financial independence at a 4% withdrawal
    rate. Companion to the withdrawal-math writing on Firenomics
    <https://firenomics.com>.
